  [[collision-staleness-detection]], [[first-principles-grounding]] (lead session);
  [[session-cycle-ergonomics]], [[substrate-independence]] (context-inheriting forks,
  one file each — partition held beside grok's concurrent batch). Rows flipped
  proposed→drafted; all five matched expected-type. Format: frontmatter (slug/type) +
  italic summary + body + Strength & grounds + Working Notes. Register discipline:
  everything estate-internal marked heuristic/lived with shared-authorship caution;
  tier reports as-of dated. Fork friction report worth keeping: "Strength & grounds"
  smears evidence-kind and strength into prose — the axis-collapse udon-needs splits;
